<topic xml:id="more-info-automated-installation-agama"
 role="glue" xml:lang="en"
 xmlns="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook" version="5.2"
 xmlns:its="http://www.w3.org/2005/11/its"
 xmlns:xi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XInclude"
 xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
 xmlns:trans="http://docbook.org/ns/transclusion">
  <info>
    <title>For more information</title>
    <!-- can be changed via merge in the
      assembly -->
    <meta name="maintainer" content="souvik.sarkar@suse.com" its:translate="no"/>
    <!-- can be changed via merge in the assembly -->
  </info>
  <para>
    For more information on &agama; and automated installation, refer to the following resources:
  </para>
  <warning>
    <title>Use upstream information with caution</title>
    <para>
      The upstream resources listed below may contain code or information not covered under the
      terms of service by &suse;. Use them with caution only as a reference for clarity and
      inspiration.
    </para>
  </warning>
  <itemizedlist>
    <listitem>
      <para>
        <link xlink:href="https://github.com/agama-project/agama">&agama; project on GitHub</link>:
        Contains the source code for the &agama; installer, useful for inspecting its internals
        directly.
      </para>
      <itemizedlist>
        <listitem>
          <para>
            <link
            xlink:href="https://github.com/agama-project/agama/blob/master/rust/share/profile.schema.json">&agama;
            profile schema</link>
          </para>
        </listitem>
        <listitem>
          <para>
            <link
          xlink:href="https://github.com/agama-project/agama/blob/master/rust/share/examples/profile.jsonnet">&agama;
            profile example in Jsonnet</link>
          </para>
        </listitem>
        <listitem>
          <para>
            <link
         xlink:href="https://github.com/agama-project/agama/blob/master/rust/share/storage.schema.json">&agama;
            storage schema</link>
          </para>
        </listitem>
        <listitem>
          <para>
            <link
         xlink:href="https://github.com/agama-project/agama/tree/master/rust/share/examples/storage">&agama;
            storage examples</link>
          </para>
        </listitem>
      </itemizedlist>
    </listitem>
    <listitem>
     <para>
      For a broader comparison of &agama; against &yast; and &ay;, and other &suselinux;&nbsp;16
      installer and deployment changes, refer to
      <link xlink:href="https://documentation.suse.com/sles/16.0/html/SLE-comparison/index.html#migration-guide-sle16-installation">How
      to install and deploy &suselinux;&nbsp;16 with &agama;</link>.
     </para>
    </listitem>
    <listitem>
     <para>
      For setting up a PXE boot server to deploy &agama; over the network, refer to
      <link xlink:href="https://documentation.suse.com/sles/16.0/html/SLES-PXE-server/"/>.
     </para>
    </listitem>
    <listitem>
     <para>
      For reusing an existing &ay; profile with &agama;, and which &ay; profile sections
      &agama; supports, refer to
      <link xlink:href="https://documentation.suse.com/sles/16.0/html/SLES-x86-64-agama-autoyast-profiles/index.html">Using
      &ay; Profiles with &agama;</link>.
     </para>
    </listitem>
   </itemizedlist>
</topic>
